<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>伸生スクラップ｜LINEで安心メンテ</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@500;700;900&family=Oswald:wght@500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#1B66C9;
    --navy-2:#EAF3FF;
    --paper:#FFFFFF;
    --paper-2:#E1EEFC;
    --ink:#132A44;
    --ink-soft:#4C6178;
    --blue:#3B93F5;
    --blue-deep:#1B66C9;
    --red:#D0473F;
    --line-green:#06C755;
    --line-green-deep:#04A648;
    --muted:#7A8CA0;
    --stripe: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--blue) 0 18px, #FFFFFF 18px 36px);
    --radius: 2px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.75;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.disp{
    font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    margin:0;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.22em;
    font-size:.75rem;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .num{ font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:700; }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  .stripe-bar{ height:14px; background: var(--stripe); }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    background:
      radial-gradient(1100px 500px at 85% -10%, rgba(59,147,245,.16), transparent 60%),
      var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:64px 0 56px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:auto -10% -60% -10%;
    height:220px;
    background:var(--navy-2);
    transform:rotate(-3deg);
    opacity:.7;
  }
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .hero .img-slot{order:-1;min-height:200px;} }
  .hero .eyebrow{color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,5.4vw,3.4rem);
    color:var(--ink);
    margin-top:14px;
    line-height:1.35;
  }
  .hero h1 .accent{color:var(--blue);}
  .hero p.lead{
    margin-top:20px;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:34em;
  }
  .badge-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px;}
  .badge{
    border:1px solid rgba(59,147,245,.45);
    color:var(--blue-deep);
    font-size:.82rem;
    font-weight:700;
    padding:8px 14px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:rgba(59,147,245,.08);
  }
  .cta-line{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    margin-top:32px;
    background:var(--line-green);
    color:#fff;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    padding:16px 30px;
    border-radius:8px;
    text-decoration:none;
    box-shadow:0 10px 26px -8px rgba(6,199,85,.55);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  .cta-line:hover{ background:var(--line-green-deep); transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 14px 30px -8px rgba(6,199,85,.6);}
  .cta-line:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue); outline-offset:3px;}
  .cta-line svg{width:22px;height:22px;flex:none;}
  .cta-sub{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);}

  /* ---------- 画像スロット（あとで <img> に差し替える枠） ---------- */
  .img-slot{
    border:2px dashed rgba(59,147,245,.5);
    border-radius:10px;
    background:rgba(59,147,245,.06);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.82rem;
    padding:20px;
    min-height:220px;
  }
  .img-slot span{max-width:16em;}
  .img-slot img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;}
  .img-slot:has(img){
    border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:var(--paper-2);
    border-left:6px solid var(--blue);
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:14px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(19,42,68,.06);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .img-slot{min-height:280px;}

  /* ---------- SECTION generic ---------- */
  section{padding:64px 0;}
  section.dark{background:var(--navy-2);color:var(--ink);}
  .section-head{max-width:36em;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .section-head .eyebrow{color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .dark .section-head .eyebrow{color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,1.9rem);margin-top:10px;}

  /* ---------- TAG component (signature element) ---------- */
  .tag{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--paper-2);
    border-left:6px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:26px 26px 22px 30px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 0 var(--paper-2);
  }
  .tag::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; left:-6px; top:22px;
    width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--navy);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--paper);
  }
  .tag .tag-label{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;}
  .tag.warn{border-left-color:var(--red);}
  .tag.warn .tag-label{color:var(--red);}

  /* Problem: cost warning tag */
  .cost-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center;}
  .cost-figure{
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px 20px;
  }
  .cost-figure .num{
    font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,3.6rem);
    color:var(--red);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .cost-figure .num small{font-size:.42em;font-weight:600;margin-left:4px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .cost-figure p{margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.92rem;}

  /* Risk list */
  .risk-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;}
  .risk-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:14px;}
  .risk-list li{
    display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .risk-list li::before{
    content:"!";
    flex:none;
    width:22px;height:22px;
    border-radius:4px;
    background:var(--red);
    color:#fff;
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:700;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:.85rem;
    margin-top:2px;
  }
  .stat-tag{align-self:start;}
  .stat-tag .num{font-size:2.3rem;color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .dark .stat-tag{background:var(--paper);border-color:var(--paper-2);color:var(--ink);}
  .dark .stat-tag .tag-label{color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .dark .stat-tag .num{color:var(--blue-deep);}

  /* Checklist / work order card */
  .order-card{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px dashed rgba(59,147,245,.5);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:32px;
    color:var(--ink);
    box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(19,42,68,.06);
  }
  .order-card h3{color:var(--blue-deep);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .check-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:14px;}
  .check-grid li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:.96rem;}
  .check-grid li::before{
    content:"✓";
    flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--blue);color:#fff;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-weight:900;font-size:.78rem;margin-top:1px;
  }

  .step-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:14px;counter-reset:step;}
  .step-grid li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:.96rem;counter-increment:step;}
  .step-grid li::before{
    content:counter(step);
    flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--blue);color:#fff;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-weight:900;font-size:.82rem;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;margin-top:1px;
  }

  /* Coupon */
  .coupon-strip{
    margin-top:34px;
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    background:var(--blue-deep);
    color:var(--paper);
    padding:22px 28px;
    border-radius:8px;
  }
  .coupon-strip .cta-line{background:var(--ink);box-shadow:none;}
  .coupon-strip .cta-line:hover{background:#000;}
  .coupon-text{font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;}
  .coupon-text small{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:.82rem;margin-top:2px;}

  /* Price tags */
  .price-section .section-head{max-width:none;}
  .price-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:8px;}
  .price-tag{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--paper-2);
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:20px 18px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .price-tag::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;
    width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--paper);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ink-soft) inset;
  }
  .price-tag h4{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;letter-spacing:.05em;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .price-tag .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:3px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--paper-2);}
  .price-tag .total{
    margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;
  }
  .price-tag .total .num{font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--red);}

  .oil-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:36px;}
  .oil-card{
    background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    border:1px solid var(--paper-2);
    border-radius:8px;padding:22px;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(19,42,68,.05);
  }
  .oil-card .model{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);letter-spacing:.05em;}
  .oil-card .calc{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;}
  .oil-card .price{text-align:right;}
  .oil-card .price .num{font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .oil-card .price small{display:block;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);}

  /* Parts grid */
  .parts-grid{
    margin-top:36px;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:10px;
  }
  .part-chip{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);
    border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    font-size:.82rem;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .part-chip .p{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .price-note{margin-top:18px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);}
  .dark .price-note{color:var(--muted);}

  /* Notify */
  .notify-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;}
  .notify-card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);border-left:6px solid var(--line-green);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;}
  .notify-card h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .notify-card p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;}

  /* Reviews */
  .review-summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .review-summary .num{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:2rem;color:var(--blue-deep);}
  .review-summary .stars{color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:1.1rem;}
  .review-summary .count{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .review-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;}
  .review-card{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);border-radius:8px;
    padding:22px;box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(19,42,68,.05);
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;
  }
  .review-card .stars{color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:.95rem;}
  .review-card p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;flex:1;}
  .review-meta{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;}

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-list{display:grid;gap:12px;}
  .faq-item{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;}
  .faq-item summary{
    cursor:pointer;list-style:none;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;
    padding:18px 22px;font-weight:700;font-size:.96rem;color:var(--ink);
  }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .faq-item summary .q-mark{color:var(--blue-deep);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;margin-right:10px;}
  .faq-item summary .icon{
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--blue-deep);flex:none;
    transition:transform .2s ease;
  }
  .faq-item[open] summary .icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
  .faq-item .faq-a{padding:0 22px 20px 52px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* used cars */
  .used-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:10px;}
  .used-link-btn{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);border-left:6px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:18px 20px;
    font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--blue-deep);
    text-decoration:none;
    box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(19,42,68,.05);
    transition:background .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .used-link-btn:hover{background:var(--navy-2);transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .used-link-btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;}

  /* 営業日案内 */
  .hours-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:start;}
  .hours-col{display:grid;gap:16px;}
  .hours-card{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);
    border-left:6px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:22px 24px;
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  }
  .hours-card dl{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:6px 16px;}
  .hours-card dt{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);white-space:nowrap;}
  .hours-card dd{margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;}
  .hours-note{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:22em;}

  .cal-card{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-2);
    border-left:6px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:18px 20px;
    max-width:340px;
  }
  .cal-card .tag-label{
    font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--blue-deep);
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .cal-card h4{margin:10px 0 14px;font-size:.95rem;}
  .cal-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .cal-nav button{
    background:var(--paper-2);border:none;border-radius:6px;
    width:28px;height:28px;font-size:1rem;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;color:var(--blue-deep);
    transition:background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .cal-nav button:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--blue);color:#fff;}
  .cal-nav button:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:not-allowed;}
  .cal-nav button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px;}
  .cal-month-label{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:.88rem;letter-spacing:.04em;}
  .cal-weekdays{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);text-align:center;font-size:.64rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px;}
  .cal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:3px;}
  .cal-cell{
    aspect-ratio:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    border-radius:5px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .cal-cell.closed{background:rgba(59,147,245,.16);color:var(--blue-deep);font-weight:700;}
  .cal-cell.empty{visibility:hidden;}
  .cal-legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .cal-legend span.swatch{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(59,147,245,.16);display:inline-block;}

  .map-col{height:100%;}
  .map-embed{
    width:100%;height:100%;min-height:360px;
    border:0;border-radius:8px;
    display:block;
  }

  /* footer */
  footer{background:var(--blue-deep);color:#CFE2FB;padding:44px 0 36px;font-size:.85rem;}
  footer .fname{color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif;}
  footer .frow{margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px;}
  footer .final-cta{margin-top:26px;}

  /* reveal animation */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none;}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none;}
    .cta-line:hover{transform:none;}
  }

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .cost-block, .risk-grid, .notify-grid, .used-grid, .oil-cards, .review-grid, .hours-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .price-tabs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .parts-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .cal-card{max-width:none;}
    .map-embed{min-height:280px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:520px){
    .price-tabs{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .badge-row{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
    section{padding:48px 0;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;justify-content:center;">
    <a href="https://lin.ee/suZz0dHn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;width:100%;">
      <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/622821_dcb2ddcaaa9b4d0684a84e5bd50308f8~mv2.png" alt="伸生スクラップ カーメンテナンス。忙しくても、愛車を忘れない。国家資格の整備士がLINEでサポート。友だち追加で作業工賃1,000円引き。まずはLINEで無料登録" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -24px rgba(19,42,68,.4);">
    </a>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="stripe-bar"></div>

<!-- PROBLEM: cost -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="img-slot reveal" style="height:auto;margin-bottom:34px;">
      <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/622821_f9d96a71f0a44d9eb80883626f67aa6c~mv2.png" alt="オイル交換を先延ばしにすると、こんな出費に。エンジンオーバーホール費用30万円〜70万円" style="height:auto;object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px;">
    </div>
    <div class="cost-block">
      <div class="tag warn reveal">
        <p class="tag-label">Engine Overhaul Cost</p>
        <div class="cost-figure">
          <div class="num">30<small>万円</small> 〜 70<small>万円</small></div>
          <p>オイル交換を怠りエンジンが故障し、載せ替えとなった場合の目安額です。軽自動車での金額で、車体が大きくなるほどさらに高額になります。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">オイル交換はエンジンを守るための一番シンプルなメンテナンスです。交換時期をうっかり忘れてしまうことが、いちばんの落とし穴になります。</p>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:14px;">だからこそ、伸生スクラップでは<strong>LINEで交換時期を自動リマインド</strong>。忘れる心配そのものをなくします。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RISK: shaken -->
